Text: We also proposed a simulated an- nealing based algorithm to extract verb patterns. We lever- age patterns’ typicality to accelerate the convergence by pattern-based candidate generation. Experiments justify the high precision and coverage of our extracted patterns. We also presented a successful application of verb patterns into context-aware conceptualization.

