Text: If v + e is an idiom pattern, we stop the conceptualization. Settings and Results For the two datasets used in the ex- perimental section, we use both approaches to conceptual- ize objects in all verb phrases. Then, we select the concept with the highest probability as the label of the object. We randomly select 100 phrases for which the two approaches generate different labels. For each difference, we manually label if our result is better than, equal to, or worse than the competitor.

