Text: Test data We use two data sets to show our solution can achieve consistent effectiveness on both short text and long text. The short text data set contains 1.6 millions of tweets from Twitter (Go, Bhayani, and Huang 2009). The long text data set contains 21,578 news articles from Reuters (Apt´e, Damerau, and Weiss 1994).

